OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear,
OL,6,Fchilly evening, before cloud thickens
OL,7,Ffrom the southwest overnight. Perhaps
OL,8,Fthe odd frost patch. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening for a time after
OL,10,Fmidnight, especially along coasts,
OL,11,Fwith rain quickly spreading north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FLargely wet start with
OL,14,Fpersistent rain for some. Perhaps
OL,15,Fdrier for a time, but risk of showers
OL,16,Fand further rain arriving later. Winds
OL,17,Falso strengthening, especially later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
